      "text": "[105103] [fog_233792] 调用结果: 70\n[105104] [赋值] obj: [Function: charCodeAt], value: 255\n[105105] [MATH]: 70 & 255 = 70\n[105106] [赋值] obj: 255, value: 8\n[105107] [MATH]: 70 << 8 = 17920\n[105108] [MATH]: 11206656 | 17920 = 11224576",
